# Export from dev (file system development mode) with the FSM question: UtkYachtRental has nothing the load would
# delete, so "Load into the DB, then export" comes first. Dev only; the load writes only what differs on disk.
Enter                 # main menu: Export
Enter                 # dev
Enter                 # What to export? -> Select (by hand)
text:utkyacht
Enter                 # open UtkYachtRental
Space                 # Objects
Esc
F2                    # summary
wait:summary
Down
Down
Down                  # Export (Check, Mapping, Save, Export, Import, Back, Menu)
Enter
wait:FSM question
Enter                 # Load into the DB, then export
wait:loaded, archive path
Enter                 # default path
wait:exported
Enter                 # pause
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # Menu
Enter                 # leave (the archive was written, so no question)
wait:main menu
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # (Language)
Enter                 # Quit
